# AC-FLUID-OPT-500ML Fluid Additive Batch Sheet

**Batch Target:** 500.0 mL (412.50 g at target density 0.825 g/cm^3)

## Component Weighing Schedule

| Order | Component Name | Function | Target wt% | Mass (g) | Tolerance |
| :---: | :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: |
| 1 | PAO 4 Base Oil | Base Carrier | 96.21% | 396.87 g | +/- 0.50 g |
| 2 | Comb-PMA Copolymer | VI Retention | 2.20% | 9.08 g | +/- 0.05 g |
| 3 | Star-Branched HSI | Viscoelastic Lift | 1.25% | 5.16 g | +/- 0.02 g |
| 4 | Polyacrylate De-aerator | Air Release | 0.25% | 1.03 g | +/- 0.01 g |
| 5 | Organo-Silicone | Surface Tension | 0.05% | 0.206 g | +/- 0.002 g |
