| **Total** | | | **100.00%** | **412.50 g** | |

## Step-by-Step Mixing Protocol
1. Charge 396.87 g PAO 4 into jacketed reactor; heat to 60°C under 300 RPM paddle agitation.
2. Slowly add 9.08 g Comb-PMA; ramp speed to 1200 RPM and mix for 15 minutes.
3. Add 5.16 g Star-HSI polymer; increase speed to 1800 RPM and hold at 60°C for 30 minutes until fully dissolved.
4. Cool batch to 40°C. Add 1.03 g De-aerator, 0.206 g Organo-Silicone, and 0.165 g PFPE Ester.
5. Stir at 1000 RPM for 15 minutes. High-shear mix at 3000 RPM for 3 minutes.
6. Vacuum de-aerate at < 10 mbar for 20 minutes at 40°C.
